    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000,
    "bgEffectTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ファン",
    "text": "やばいって……！\r\nふゆちゃんのプライベートとか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ファンの友人",
    "text": "仕事の打ち合わせっぽくない？\r\n雰囲気",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ファン",
    "text": "普段見れないって意味では一緒じゃん\r\n……やばい、帰り事故るやつだこれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00011",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000,
    "bgEffectTime": 500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌編集者",
    "text": "たくさん撮られてきたと思うんですけど\r\n今回、ちょっと趣向を変えたいなと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑誌編集者",
    "text": "黛さんの本質というか、根源というか……\r\nもっと根底にある魅力を引き出せないかなって思いまして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018017010030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ありがとうございますっ\r\nご提案はとっても嬉しいのですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201801701/2018017010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2018017010040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "授業で少しかじった程度ですし\r\nプロの方に比べたら、ふゆなんて全然……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201801701/2018017010040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "mask_on",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textFrame": "off",
